# Round 80: the vec guard's (long)ctr == 0 truncation admitted any
# counter start in (-1, 1) -- `i is 0.5` ran the integer-lane
# vector path (wrong indices AND values, rc 0) where the VM dies
# "index must be an integer, got 0.5". The guard is an exact
# double compare now. _err class: both die, equal codes.
b is buffer of 6
i is 0.5
loop while i < 3:
    b[i] is i
    i is i + 1
print of i
print of b[0]
print of b[1]
